      "audioText": "At the community launch, Ava finished the budget note and will check the data, while Ben prepares the slides. The client update is urgent, the data file is blocked, and Friday is impossible; they ask when it will be ready and confirm Monday. The team confirms the plan: priority is visible, progress continues, and each owner knows the action, request, current blocker and deadline.",
